<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:ns1="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Ngurangi Wilangan Cacah</title>
<metadata>
  <ns1:content-id>m81245</ns1:content-id>
  <ns1:title>Ngurangi Wilangan Cacah</ns1:title>
  <ns1:abstract><para id="para-00001">Sawise sinau bagean iki, kowe bakal bisa:</para><list id="list-00001">
<item>Nggunakake notasi pangurangan</item>
<item>Nggambarake pangurangan wilangan cacah nganggo model</item>
<item>Ngurangi wilangan cacah</item>
<item>Ngowahi frasa tembung dadi notasi matematika</item>
<item>Ngurangi wilangan cacah ing penerapan</item>
</list></ns1:abstract>
  <ns1:uuid>b7b437ef-73c1-446d-a42c-7a7ebe933114</ns1:uuid>
</metadata>

<content>
<note id="fs-id2649398" class="be-prepared">
<para id="fs-id1376163">Sadurunge miwiti, coba garapen kuis kesiapan iki.</para>
<exercise id="fs-idm325648832"><problem id="fs-idm333083312">
<para id="fs-idm342720096">Gambarna nganggo model <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nganggo blok basis-10.<newline />
Yen wangsulanmu ing soal iki salah, sinaunen maneh <link document="m81244" target-id="fs-id1239606" />.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm341787200">
<media id="eip-id1168468728290" alt="Kothak-kothak jambon nggambarake soal panambahan 3 + 4 = 7: telung kothak ditambah patang kothak padha karo pitung kothak."><image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_001_img.jpeg" /></media>
</solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id1122445" class="be-prepared">
<exercise id="fs-idm326061088">
<problem id="fs-idm342895408">
<para id="fs-idm349152624">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>324</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>586</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math><newline />
Yen wangsulanmu ing soal iki salah, sinaunen maneh <link document="m81244" target-id="fs-id1988116" />.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm343972784">
<para id="fs-idm331022384"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>910</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise></note>
<section id="fs-id1799687">
<title>Nggunakake Notasi Pangurangan</title>
<para id="fs-id1885623">Upamane ana pitung gedhang ing mangkuk. Elana njupuk telu kanggo nggawe smoothie. Kari pira gedhang ing mangkuk? Kanggo mangsuli, kita ngurangi telu saka pitu. Nalika ngurangi, kita njupuk sawijining wilangan saka wilangan liyane supaya ngerti <term id="term-00001">selisih</term>. Notasi sing kita gunakake kanggo ngurangi <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> saka <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> yaiku</para>
<equation id="fs-id1467448" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id2670515">Kita maca <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> minangka <emphasis effect="italics">pitu dikurangi telu</emphasis>, lan asile <emphasis effect="italics">selisih pitu lan telu</emphasis>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1718072">
<title>Notasi Pangurangan</title>
<para id="fs-id1499865">Kanggo nerangake pangurangan, kita bisa nganggo simbol lan tembung.</para>
<table id="fs-id2434601" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki ana rong baris lan limang kolom. Baris paling ndhuwur isine judhul. Saka kiwa menyang tengen, judhul kolome yaiku operasi, notasi, ekspresi, diwaca, lan asil. Ing sangisore operasi ana pangurangan; ing sangisore notasi ana tandha kurang; ing sangisore ekspresi ana pitu dikurangi telu; ing sangisore diwaca ana tembung pitu dikurangi telu; lan ing sangisore asil ana tembung selisih 7 lan 3.">
<label />
<tgroup cols="5">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Operasi</entry>
<entry align="left">Notasi</entry>
<entry align="left">Ekspresi</entry>
<entry align="left">Diwaca</entry>
<entry align="left">Asil</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Pangurangan</entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left">pitu dikurangi telu</entry>
<entry align="left">selisih <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</note>
<example id="fs-id2300581">
<exercise id="fs-id2218104"><problem id="fs-id2702122">
<para id="fs-id1465049">Owahana notasi matematika iki dadi tembung: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>26</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:math>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id4303008">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<list id="eip-id1168289601814" list-type="labeled-item" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Iki diwaca <emphasis effect="italics">wolu dikurangi siji</emphasis>. Asile <emphasis effect="italics">selisih wolu lan siji</emphasis>.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Iki diwaca <emphasis effect="italics">nemlikur dikurangi patbelas</emphasis>. Asile <emphasis effect="italics">selisih nemlikur lan patbelas</emphasis>.</item></list></solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id1572252" class="try">
<para id="fs-id2134775">Owahana notasi matematika iki dadi tembung:</para>
<exercise id="fs-id1402228"><problem id="fs-id1931803">
<list id="eip-id1168288638005" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>29</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:math></item></list>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1627288">
<list id="eip-id1168287497635" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> rolas dikurangi papat; selisih rolas lan papat </item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> sangalikur dikurangi sewelas; selisih sangalikur lan sewelas</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id1357992" class="try">
<para id="fs-id1406214">Owahana notasi matematika iki dadi tembung:</para>
<exercise id="fs-id2650087"><problem id="fs-id3242039">
<list id="eip-id1168288312416" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>29</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:math></item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1474721">
<list id="eip-id1168288179457" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> sewelas dikurangi loro; selisih sewelas lan loro </item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> sangalikur dikurangi rolas; selisih sangalikur lan rolas</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
</section>
<section id="fs-id1824154"><title>Nggambarake Pangurangan Wilangan Cacah Nganggo Model</title><para id="fs-id1515766">Model bisa mbantu kita mbayangake carane ngurangi, kaya nalika kita sinau nambah. Kita bakal nganggo maneh blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>. Elinga, siji blok makili 1 lan siji batang makili 10. Ayo gawe model ekspresi pangurangan sing lagi wae kita rembug, yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para><table id="eip-696" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake carane ngurangi 3 saka 7 nganggo blok, wiwit nggawe model nganti entuk asil matematika pungkasan."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Kita miwiti kanthi nggawe model wilangan kapisan, yaiku 7.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287103791" alt="Ing gambar ana pitung kothak klawu kanthi garis pinggir, lan angka 7 ing sangisore."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_018_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Saiki jupuken wilangan kapindho, yaiku 3. Kita bunderana 3 blok supaya cetha yen blok kuwi dijupuk.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168289649847" alt="Ing gambar ana telung kothak klawu kanthi garis pinggir sing dibunderi abang, ana sela, banjur patang kothak klawu kanthi garis pinggir sing ora dibunderi."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_018_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Etungen blok sing isih ana.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287507388" alt="Patang kothak klawu enom kanthi garis pinggir peteng lan wewayangan tipis dijejer horisontal ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_018_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kari 4 blok satuan.</entry>
    <entry>Kita wis nuduhake yen <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math>.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table>
<example id="fs-id1607526">
<exercise id="fs-id1542638"><problem id="fs-id2908746">
<para id="fs-id1684104">Gawea model pangurangan iki: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2587738">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="eip-35" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar iki ana rong kolom. Kolom kiwa isine katrangan lan kolom tengen isine blok basis-10. Kolom kiwa nerangake yen 8 dikurangi 2 tegese selisih 8 lan 2. Wilangan kapisan, 8, dimodelake nganggo 8 blok satuan kanthi label 8 ing ngisore. Baris sabanjure ngajak kita njupuk wilangan kapindho, 2, banjur nuduhake 8 blok sing padha kanthi rong blok kapisan dibunderi. Baris sabanjure ngajak kita ngetung blok sing isih ana lan nuduhake nem blok satuan. Baris paling ngisor nerangake yen kari nem blok satuan lan 8 dikurangi 2 padha karo 6."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> tegese selisih 8 lan 2.</entry>

    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gawea model wilangan kapisan, yaiku 8.</entry>

    <entry align="right"><media id="eip-id1168288533358" alt="Wolung kothak biru enom kanthi garis pinggir peteng dijejer sabaris. Angka 8 ana ing tengah pas ing ngisore, ing latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_019_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Jupuken wilangan kapindho, yaiku 2.</entry>

    <entry align="right"><media id="eip-id1168288533378" alt="Wolung kothak biru enom kanthi garis pinggir peteng dijejer sabaris. Rong kothak kapisan dibunderi abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_019_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Etungen blok sing isih ana.</entry>

    <entry align="right"><media id="eip-id1168288508023" alt="Nem kothak biru enom kanthi garis pinggir peteng dijejer sabaris."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_019_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kari 6 blok satuan.</entry>

    <entry>Kita wis nuduhake yen <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math>.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>



</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id1825040" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1613938">
<problem id="fs-id1384402">
<para id="fs-id2174662">Gambarna nganggo model: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1546209">
<para id="fs-id1171105575889"><newline /><media id="fs-id2262938" alt="Gambar nuduhake blok kanggo nerangake soal pangurangan 9 − 6.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_006.jpg" />
</media></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1371643" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id873971">
<problem id="fs-id1224533">
<para id="fs-id1516112">Gambarna nganggo model: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2269751">
<para id="fs-id1171105216187"><newline /><media id="fs-id2793179" alt="Gambar nuduhake blok kanggo nerangake soal pangurangan 6 − 1.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_007.jpg" />
</media></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id2202888"><exercise id="fs-id2334164"><problem id="fs-id2274296">
<para id="fs-id2597279">Gawea model pangurangan iki: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id577210">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>




<table id="eip-811" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar iki ana rong kolom. Kolom kiwa isine katrangan lan kolom tengen isine blok basis-10. Kolom kiwa nerangake: gawea model wilangan kapisan, 13, nganggo 1 puluhan lan 3 satuan. Baris sabanjure ngajak kita njupuk wilangan kapindho, 8. Amarga ora ana wolung satuan, 1 puluhan diijolake karo 10 satuan. Baris sabanjure njupuk 8 satuan, banjur ngetung blok sing isih ana. Baris paling ngisor nerangake yen kari limang blok satuan lan 13 dikurangi 8 padha karo 5."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Gawea model wilangan kapisan, yaiku 13. Kita nganggo 1 puluhan lan 3 satuan.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288669333" alt="Sepuluh blok biru enom dijejer horisontal, banjur ana sela lan telung blok maneh."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_020_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Jupuken wilangan kapindho, yaiku 8. Nanging satuane ora ana 8, mula ayo ngijolake 1 puluhan karo 10 satuan.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288455204" alt="Ing latar putih ana rong klompok kothak biru enom kanthi garis pinggir peteng. Sawijining klompok isine 10 kothak lan liyane 3 kothak, kanthi angka 10 lan 3 ing ngisore saben klompok."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_020_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Saiki kita bisa njupuk 8 satuan.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288455224" alt="Kothak-kothak biru enom dijejer. Wolung kothak diubengi oval magenta karo panah nuding kiwa ing ngisore. Limang kothak liyane ana ing tengen."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_020_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Etungen blok sing isih ana.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288455244" alt="Limang kothak biru enom kanthi garis pinggir peteng dijejer sabaris. Ana sela cilik antarane rong kothak kapisan lan telung kothak liyane."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_020_img-05.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kari limang satuan.</entry>

    <entry>Kita wis nuduhake yen <m:math><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math>.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1328228">Kaya nalika nambah, model kuwi bisa diarani blok satuan lan batang puluhan, utawa cukup satuan lan puluhan.</para>
</solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id2263240" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2687887">
<problem id="fs-id1578480">
<para id="fs-id1799661">Gawea model pangurangan iki: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2563009">
<para id="fs-id1171103469437"><newline /><media id="fs-id2774892" alt="Gambar nuduhake blok kanggo nggawe model persamaan pangurangan 12 − 7.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_011_img.jpg" />
</media></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id2773418" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2483714">
<problem id="fs-id2220439">
<para id="fs-id1785004">Gawea model pangurangan iki: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1804344">
<para id="fs-id1171105153945"><newline /><media id="fs-id1727244" alt="Gambar nuduhake blok kanggo nggawe model persamaan pangurangan 14 − 8.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_012_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1288084">
<exercise id="fs-id2340048">
<problem id="fs-id1578323">
<para id="fs-id3459337">Gawea model pangurangan iki: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>43</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1206516">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id1169751">Amarga <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>43</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> tegese saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>43</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kita njupuk <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>26</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> kita miwiti kanthi nggawe model <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>43</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math><newline />
<media id="fs-id1611327" alt="Gambar ana rong bagean. Bagean kapisan ana 4 batang horisontal sing saben batang isine 10 blok. Bagean kapindho ana 3 blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_013_img.jpg" />
</media></para><para id="fs-id2316259">Saiki kita perlu njupuk <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>26</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> yaiku <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> puluhan lan <m:math><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math> satuan. Kita ora bisa njupuk <m:math><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math> satuan saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> satuan. Mula, kita ngijolake <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> puluhan karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> satuan.<newline />
<media id="fs-id1376326" alt="Gambar iki ana rong klompok. Klompok kapisan ing kiwa ana 3 baris blok basis-10 biru lan 1 baris abang isi 10 blok, kanthi label 4 puluhan. Ing jejere baris kapisan blok puluhan ana 3 blok satuan kanthi label 3 satuan. Panah nuding tengen menyang klompok kapindho sing ana telung baris blok basis-10 kanthi label 3 puluhan. Ing jejere ana sabaris isi 3 blok biru lan rong baris abang sing saben baris isine limang blok satuan, kanthi label 13 satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_014_img.jpg" />
</media></para><para id="fs-id3330866">Saiki kita bisa njupuk <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> puluhan lan <m:math><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math> satuan.<newline />
<media id="fs-id1549996" alt="Ing ndhuwur gambar ana sabaris blok basis-10 karo pitung blok satuan ing jejere. Ing ngisore ana rong baris blok basis-10 lan rong baris sing saben baris isine 3 blok satuan, kabeh dibunderi. Panah nuding tengen lan nuduhake sabaris isi sepuluh blok karo pitung blok satuan ing ngisore.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_015_img.jpg" />
</media></para><para id="fs-id2825677">Etungen blok sing isih ana. Ana <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> puluhan lan <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> satuan, yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id3407420"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>43</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id2208961" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2297200">
<problem id="fs-id2443471">
<para id="fs-id2486354">Gawea model pangurangan iki: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>42</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1547971">
<para id="fs-id1171105202604"><newline /><media id="fs-id2425624" alt="Gambar statis 42 dikurangi 27 sawisé diklompokaké manèh: ana telung puluhan lan rolas satuan. Rong puluhan lan pitung satuan dibunderi dadi sing dijupuk; kari siji puluhan lan limang satuan. Persamaan sing kacithak yaiku 42 dikurangi 27 padha karo 15.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_016_img.jpg" />
</media></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id2956827" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1484755">
<problem id="fs-id1242400">
<para id="fs-id1366955">Gawea model pangurangan iki: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>45</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>29</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1312188">
<para id="fs-id1171105081052"><newline /><media id="fs-id2643011" alt="Gambar statis 45 dikurangi 29 sawisé diklompokaké manèh: ana telung puluhan lan limalas satuan. Rong puluhan lan sangang satuan dibunderi dadi sing dijupuk; kari siji puluhan lan nem satuan. Persamaan sing kacithak yaiku 45 dikurangi 29 padha karo 16.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_017_img.jpg" />
</media></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section><section id="fs-id1185692">
<title>Ngurangi Wilangan Cacah</title>
<para id="fs-id2197106">Panambahan lan pangurangan iku operasi invers. Panambahan bisa mbalekake pangurangan, lan pangurangan bisa mbalekake panambahan.</para><para id="fs-id2609724">Kita ngerti yen <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> amarga <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Yen wis nguwasani kabeh fakta wilangan ing panambahan, kita luwih gampang ngurangi. Banjur kita bisa mriksa pangurangan nganggo panambahan. Asil pangurangan ing tuladha ndhuwur bisa dipriksa kanthi nambah.</para>
<equation id="fs-id2898525" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="1em" /><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>amarga</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="1em" /><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.5em" /><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>amarga</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="1em" /><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>43</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>amarga</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd /><m:mtd /><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>43</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></equation>
<example id="fs-id1977308">
<exercise id="fs-id2587230"><problem id="fs-id1381184">
<para id="fs-id1960002">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah:<list id="eip-id1168288203278" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:math></item></list></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1604624">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="eip-id1168287570371" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Gambar carane ngurangi 7 saka 9, karo ekspresi, asil, lan cara mriksa kanthi nambah."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row><entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> </entry><entry /></row>
  <row>
    <entry />
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kurangana 7 saka 9.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
<row><entry>Priksa kanthi nambah.<newline /><m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>✓</m:mo></m:math></entry>
<entry /></row>

</tbody>


</tgroup>
</table><table id="eip-id1168288181719" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake carane ngurangi 3 saka 8, kalebu soal, asil, lan langkah mriksa."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
<row><entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> </entry><entry /></row>
<row>
    <entry />
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kurangana 3 saka 8.</entry>

    <entry><m:math><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
<row><entry>Priksa kanthi nambah.<newline /><m:math><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>✓</m:mo></m:math></entry><entry /></row>

</tbody>

</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id2719276" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2912373">
<problem id="fs-id1210785">
<para id="fs-id1629685">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah:</para>
<para id="fs-id1560767"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1951537">
<para id="fs-id693621">7 − 0 = 7; 7 + 0 = 7</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1171103437810" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2188831">
<problem id="fs-id2159977">
<para id="fs-id1171105095937">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah:</para>
<para id="fs-id1578849"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2426512">
<para id="fs-id2633348">6 − 2 = 4; 2 + 4 = 6</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id2845428">Kanggo ngurangi wilangan sing digite luwih saka siji, biasane luwih gampang yen wilangane ditulis vertikal ing kolom, kaya nalika nambah. Jejerna digite miturut nilai panggonan, banjur kurangana saben kolom wiwit satuan lan terus menyang kiwa.</para>
<example id="fs-id2475555"><exercise id="fs-id2296830">
<problem id="fs-id2296304">
<para id="fs-id1461696">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>89</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>61</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1410339">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="eip-458" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake langkah-langkah ngurangi wilangan rong digit: nata wilangan supaya sejajar, ngurangi miturut nilai panggonan, lan mriksa kanthi nambah."><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen wilangane supaya digit satuan lan puluhane sejajar vertikal.</entry>

    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr>

    <m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>89</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
    <m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>61</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>____</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd>
</m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kurangana digit ing saben nilai panggonan.<newline /><newline />Kurangana satuan: <m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>-</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:math><newline />Kurangana puluhan: <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>-</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math></entry>

    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr>

    <m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>89</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
    <m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>61</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>____</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd>
</m:mtr><m:mtr>
    <m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>28</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd>
</m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>
<row>

<entry>Priksa kanthi nambah.<newline /><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr>
    <m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>28</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
    <m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>61</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>____</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd>
</m:mtr>
<m:mtr>
    <m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>89</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd>
</m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry><entry />

</row>
</tbody>






</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1361693">Wangsulan kita bener.</para>
</solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1360708" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1629443">
<problem id="fs-id1910909">
<para id="fs-id1525494">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>86</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1410435">
<para id="fs-id2820396">86 − 54 = 32 amarga 54 + 32 = 86</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1223489" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2815009">
<problem id="fs-id2620973">
<para id="fs-id3218912">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>99</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>74</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2748218">
<para id="fs-id1800833">99 − 74 = 25 amarga 74 + 25 = 99</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1166761303752">Nalika nggawe model kanggo ngurangi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>43</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> kita ngijolake <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> puluhan karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> satuan. Yen ditindakake tanpa model, iki diarani nyilih <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> saka panggonan puluhan lan nambahake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> menyang panggonan satuan.</para>
<note id="fs-id1731638" class="howto"><title>Nggoleki selisih wilangan cacah.</title><list id="eip-id1168289617573" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Tulisen wilangane supaya saben nilai panggonan sejajar vertikal.</item>
<item>Kurangana digit ing saben nilai panggonan. Miwitia saka satuan, banjur terus saka tengen menyang kiwa. Yen digit ndhuwur luwih cilik tinimbang digit ngisor, silihen yen perlu.</item>
<item>Terusna ngurangi saben nilai panggonan saka tengen menyang kiwa. Silihen yen perlu.</item>
<item>Priksa kanthi nambah.</item></list></note><example id="fs-id1275385"><exercise id="fs-id1613753"><problem id="fs-id2164078">
<para id="fs-id1577749">Kurangana: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>43</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1348086">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="eip-640" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Pandhuan gambar langkah-langkah ngurangi wilangan kanthi nyilih, karo pituduh tinulis lan gambar sing cocog."><label /><tgroup cols="3">
  <tbody>
    <row>
      <entry>Tulisen wilangane supaya saben nilai panggonan sejajar vertikal.</entry>
      <entry><media id="eip-id1168287387607" alt="Soal pangurangan vertikal nuduhake 43 dikurangi 26 sing ditata kanggo diitung manual. Garis horisontal ing ngisore nuduhake panggonan wangsulan."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_029_img-01.png" /></media></entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>Kurangana satuane. Kita ora bisa ngurangi 6 saka 3, mula kita nyilih 1 puluhan. Saiki ana 3 puluhan lan 13 satuan. Tulisen wilangan kuwi ing ndhuwur saben panggonan, banjur coreten digit asline.</entry>
      <entry><media id="eip-id1168289655873" alt="Pangurangan vertikal iki nuduhake carane nglompokake maneh utawa nyilih kanggo 43 dikurangi 26. Angka 4 diganti dadi 3 lan angka 3 dadi 13 supaya siap dikurangi."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_029_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>Saiki kita bisa ngurangi satuane. <m:math><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>7.</m:mn></m:math> Tulisen 7 ing panggonan satuan ing selisih.</entry>
      <entry><media id="eip-id1168287220447" alt="Pangurangan vertikal iki nuduhake carane nglompokake maneh utawa nyilih kanggo 43 dikurangi 26. Angka 4 diganti dadi 3 lan angka 3 dadi 13, mula asil ing panggonan satuan yaiku 7."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_029_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>Saiki kita kurangi puluhane. <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn></m:math> Tulisen 1 ing panggonan puluhan ing selisih.</entry>
      <entry><media id="eip-id1168287397473" alt="Tuladha tulisan tangan nuduhake carane ngurangi kanthi nyilih: 43 dikurangi 26 padha karo 17."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_029_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry align="left">Priksa kanthi nambah.<newline /><newline /><media id="eip-id1168287108984" alt="Soal panambahan vertikal nuduhake yen 17 ditambah 26 padha karo 43. Tandha centhang ireng nuduhake yen wangsulane bener. Wilangane ditata rapi lan sejajar."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_029_img-05.png" /></media><newline /> Wangsulan kita bener.</entry>
                        <entry />
    </row>
  </tbody>
</tgroup></table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id2150843" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1742261">
<problem id="fs-id1701846">
<para id="fs-id2303950">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>93</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>58</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id3317038">
<para id="fs-id2135460">93 − 58 = 35 amarga 58 + 35 = 93</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1171105187191" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2840420">
<problem id="fs-id2221864">
<para id="fs-id1378267">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>81</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>39</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1693021">
<para id="fs-id2207092">81 − 39 = 42 amarga 42 + 39 = 81</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1342104"><exercise id="fs-id2170154"><problem id="fs-id2626383">
<para id="fs-id2326446">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>207</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>64</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1239022">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="eip-274" class="unnumbered unstyled has-images" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake langkah-langkah ngurangi wilangan multidigit kanthi nyilih, banjur langkah mriksa."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen wilangane supaya saben nilai panggonan sejajar vertikal. </entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288438042" alt="Soal pangurangan vertikal nuduhake 207 dikurangi 64, karo garis ing ngisore kanggo panggonan wangsulan."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_030-01.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>

<row><entry>Kurangana satuane. <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3.</m:mn></m:math> <newline /> Tulisen 3 ing panggonan satuan ing selisih.</entry>
<entry><media id="eip-id1168288437405" alt="Soal pangurangan vertikal 207 − 64 nuduhake langkah wiwitan lan asil digit satuan yaiku 3."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_030-02.png" /></media></entry></row>

<row><entry>Kurangana puluhane. Kita ora bisa ngurangi 6 saka 0, mula kita nyilih 1 atusan lan nambahake 10 puluhan menyang 0 puluhan sing ana. Saiki kita nduweni 10 puluhan. Tulisen 10 ing ndhuwur panggonan puluhan lan coreten 0. Banjur coreten 2 ing panggonan atusan lan tulisen 1 ing ndhuwure.</entry>
<entry><media id="eip-id1168288437422" alt="Soal pangurangan vertikal 207 − 64 nuduhake carane nyilih saka atusan menyang puluhan, karo asil 3 ing satuan."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_030-03.png" /></media></entry></row>

<row><entry>Saiki kita kurangi puluhane. <m:math><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.</m:mn></m:math> Tulisen 4 ing panggonan puluhan ing selisih.</entry>
<entry><media id="eip-id1168286359298" alt="Pangurangan vertikal iki nuduhake carane nyilih. Soal asline yaiku 207 dikurangi 64, karo asil sauntara 43; digit sing dicoret lan nilai anyar ing ndhuwure nuduhake panglompokan maneh."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_030-04.png" /></media></entry></row>

<row><entry>Pungkasan, kurangana atusane. Wilangan ngisor ora duwe digit atusan, mula kita bisa mbayangake angka 0 ing panggonan kuwi. Amarga <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1,</m:mn></m:math> kita nulis 1 ing panggonan atusan ing selisih.</entry><entry><media id="eip-id1168286107560" alt="Soal pangurangan vertikal nuduhake 207 dikurangi 64, kalebu carane nyilih, lan wangsulane 143."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_030-05.png" /></media></entry></row>

<row><entry align="left">Priksa kanthi nambah.

<newline /><media id="eip-id1168286107574" alt="Soal panambahan vertikal 143 + 64. Angka simpenan 1 ana ing ndhuwur digit kapisan 1 saka 143. Asile 207."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_030-06.png" /></media><newline />Wangsulan kita bener.</entry>
<entry /></row>

</tbody>

</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1346520" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1917427">
<problem id="fs-id1828463">
<para id="fs-id1597739">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>439</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>52</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1583263">
<para id="fs-id2241359">439 − 52 = 387 amarga 387 + 52 = 439</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1270084" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1827735">
<problem id="fs-id1968857">
<para id="fs-id2304206">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>318</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>75</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1581788">
<para id="fs-id2375206">318 − 75 = 243 amarga 243 + 75 = 318</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1945438">
<exercise id="fs-id2279338"><problem id="fs-id1394122">
<para id="fs-id1358072">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>910</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>586</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1633271">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="eip-537" class="unnumbered unstyled has-images" summary="Pandhuan langkah-langkah ngurangi wilangan multidigit kanthi nyilih, karo pituduh tinulis, tuladha gambar, lan pamriksa pungkasan."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen wilangane supaya saben nilai panggonan sejajar vertikal.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168286000380" alt="Soal pangurangan vertikal nuduhake 910 ing ndhuwur lan 586 ing ngisore. Garis horisontal ana ing ngisore rong wilangan kuwi, lan tandha kurang ing kiwa 586."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_031-01.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
<row><entry>Kurangana satuane. Kita ora bisa ngurangi 6 saka 0, mula kita nyilih 1 puluhan lan nambahake 10 satuan menyang 0 satuan sing ana. Saiki ana 10 satuan. Tulisen 0 ing ndhuwur panggonan puluhan lan coreten 1. Tulisen 10 ing ndhuwur panggonan satuan lan coreten 0. Saiki kita bisa ngurangi satuane. <m:math><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>4.</m:mn></m:math></entry><entry><media id="eip-id1168286081647" alt="Pangurangan vertikal nuduhake 910 dikurangi 586. Gambar iki nuduhake langkah kapisan nyilih kanggo kolom satuan: angka 1 ing puluhan dadi 0 lan angka 0 dadi 10."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_031-02.png" /></media></entry></row>

  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen 4 ing panggonan satuan ing selisih.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168286081662" alt="Pangurangan vertikal nuduhake 910 dikurangi 586. Gambar iki nuduhake langkah kapisan nyilih kanggo kolom satuan: angka 1 ing puluhan dadi 0 lan angka 0 dadi 10, mula asile 4."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_031-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kurangana puluhane. Kita ora bisa ngurangi 8 saka 0, mula kita nyilih 1 atusan lan nambahake 10 puluhan menyang 0 puluhan sing ana. Saiki ana 10 puluhan. Tulisen 8 ing ndhuwur panggonan atusan lan coreten 9. Tulisen 10 ing ndhuwur panggonan puluhan.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168286001486" alt="Pangurangan vertikal nuduhake 910 dikurangi 586. Gambar iki nuduhake langkah nyilih: angka 9 ing atusan dadi 8, panggonan puluhan dadi 10, lan panggonan satuan dadi 10. Asil ing satuan yaiku 4."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_031-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Saiki kita bisa ngurangi puluhane. <m:math><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math>.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168286120643" alt="Gambar nuduhake pangurangan susun kanthi nyilih: 910 dikurangi 586. Langkah nyilih kanggo satuan lan puluhan ngasilake 4 lan 2; atusane durung dikurangi."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_031-05.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
    <row>
    <entry>Kurangana panggonan atusan. <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> Tulisen 3 ing panggonan atusan ing selisih.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id1168286048977" alt="Soal pangurangan vertikal 910 − 586 = 324 nuduhake carane nglompokake maneh kanggo ngrampungake soal."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_031-06.png" /></media></entry></row>
   <row>
    <entry align="left">Priksa kanthi nambah. <newline /><newline /><media id="eip-id1170325408185" alt="Soal panambahan vertikal nuduhake yen 324 ditambah 586 padha karo 910. Angka simpenan ana ing ndhuwur wilangan, lan tandha centhang nuduhake yen gunggunge bener."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_031-07.png" /></media><newline /><newline />Wangsulan kita bener.</entry><entry />
  </row></tbody>



</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id1971918" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2276824">
<problem id="fs-id1168988">
<para id="fs-id2129521">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>832</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>376</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2498289">
<para id="fs-id4163390">832 − 376 = 456 amarga 456 + 376 = 832</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1171105576258" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1585831">
<problem id="fs-id2650144">
<para id="fs-id1579616">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>847</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>578</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2642642">
<para id="fs-id1249841">847 − 578 = 269 amarga 269 + 578 = 847</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1569033">
<exercise id="fs-id1392397"><problem id="fs-id146504482">
<para id="fs-id238844637">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2,162</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>479</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id178447819">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="eip-7544534" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Tabel rong kolom iki nerangake langkah-langkah pangurangan vertikal 2.162 − 479. Kolom kiwa isine pituduh lan kolom tengen isine ekspresi matematika. Digit dijejer miturut nilai panggonan. Kanthi nyilih runtut saka puluhan, atusan, lan éwuan, 2 satuan dadi 12, 5 puluhan dadi 15, lan 0 atusan dadi 10. Asil pangurangan ing satuan, puluhan, atusan, lan éwuan yaiku 3, 8, 6, lan 1, mula selisihe 1.683."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen wilangane supaya saben nilai panggonan sejajar vertikal.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id11682884288577" alt="Soal pangurangan vertikal 2162 dikurangi 479."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_028_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kurangana satuane. Kita ora bisa ngurangi 9 saka 2, mula silihen 1 puluhan lan tambahna 10 satuan menyang 2 satuan supaya dadi 12 satuan. Tulisen 5 ing ndhuwur puluhan lan coreten 6. Tulisen 12 ing ndhuwur satuan lan coreten 2.</entry>

    <entry><media id="eip-id11682848234234288577" alt="Soal pangurangan vertikal 2162 dikurangi 479 nuduhake carane nyilih. Angka 2 ing satuan dadi 12 kanthi nyilih saka angka 6 ing puluhan, sing banjur dadi 5."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_028_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Saiki kita bisa ngurangi satuane.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen 3 ing panggonan satuan ing selisih.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id11682882344278787834288577" alt="Soal pangurangan vertikal 2162 dikurangi 479. Gambar nuduhake langkah kapisan nyilih: angka 2 ing satuan dadi 12 lan angka 6 ing puluhan dadi 5, mula asil kolom satuan yaiku 3."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_028_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
<row>
<entry>Kurangana puluhane. Kita ora bisa ngurangi 7 saka 5, mula silihen 1 atusan lan tambahna 10 puluhan menyang 5 puluhan supaya dadi 15 puluhan. Tulisen 0 ing ndhuwur atusan lan coreten 1. Tulisen 15 ing ndhuwur puluhan.</entry><entry><media id="eip-id17878447168284288577" alt="Soal pangurangan vertikal 2162 dikurangi 479 nuduhake langkah nyilih: angka 2 ing satuan dadi 12; angka 6 ing puluhan dadi 5 banjur 15; lan angka 1 ing atusan dadi 0. Angka 3 ditulis ing panggonan satuan ing wangsulan."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_028_img-05.png" /></media></entry></row>
<row><entry>Saiki kita bisa ngurangi puluhane.</entry><entry><m:math><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:math></entry></row>
<row>
<entry>Tulisen 8 ing panggonan puluhan ing selisih.</entry><entry><media id="eip-id17878716828823427878784434288577" alt="Soal pangurangan vertikal 2162 dikurangi 479 nuduhake langkah nyilih: angka 2 ing satuan dadi 12, angka 6 ing puluhan dadi 15, lan angka 1 ing atusan dadi 0. Saiki wangsulane ana angka 3 ing satuan lan 8 ing puluhan."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_028_img-06.png" /></media></entry></row>

<row><entry>Saiki kita bisa ngurangi atusane.</entry><entry><media id="eip-id1787878989448284288577" alt="Soal pangurangan vertikal nuduhake langkah-langkah nyilih utawa nglompokake maneh kanggo 2162 dikurangi 479."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_028_img-07.png" /></media></entry></row>
<row><entry>Tulisen 6 ing panggonan atusan ing selisih.</entry><entry><media id="eip-id1787428844577" alt="Soal pangurangan susun nuduhake 2162 dikurangi 479 kanthi nyilih, lan asil sauntara 683. Angka 6 ing wangsulan diwernani abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_028_img-08.png" /></media></entry></row>
<row><entry>Kurangana éwuane. Wilangan ngisor ora duwe digit éwuan, mula kita mbayangake angka 0. <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1.</m:mn></m:math> Tulisen 1 ing panggonan éwuan ing selisih.</entry><entry><media id="eip-id178744428858277" alt="Soal pangurangan susun nuduhake 2162 dikurangi 479 kanthi nyilih, lan asile 1683. Angka 1 ing wangsulan diwernani abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_028_img-09.png" /></media></entry></row>
<row><entry>Priksa kanthi nambah.<newline /><newline /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr /><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="1em" /><m:mover><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mover><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mover><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.71em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.55em" /><m:mn>479</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>______</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="1.1em" /><m:mn>2,</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.3em" /><m:mn>162</m:mn><m:mo>✓</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></entry><entry />
</row>
</tbody>








</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id2687501">Wangsulan kita bener.</para>
</solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id2593949" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1388321">
<problem id="fs-id1715649">
<para id="fs-id1263162">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4,585</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>697</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1575932">
<para id="fs-id1632703">4,585 − 697 = 3,888 amarga 3,888 + 697 = 4,585</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1789710" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1397173">
<problem id="fs-id1351192">
<para id="fs-id2339954">Kurangana, banjur priksa kanthi nambah: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5,637</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>899</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1410058">
<para id="fs-id2284283">5,637 − 899 = 4,738 amarga 4,738 + 899 = 5,637</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>
<section id="fs-id2567736">
<title>Ngowahi Frasa Tembung Dadi Notasi Matematika</title>
<para id="fs-id2171599">Kaya nalika nambah, <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00002">frasa tembung</term> bisa njaluk kita ngurangi rong wilangan. Kanggo ngowahi frasa tembung dadi notasi matematika, goleka tembung kunci sing nuduhake pangurangan. Sawetara tembung kuwi ana ing <link target-id="fs-id1549826" />.</para>
<table id="fs-id1549826" aria-label="Tabel iki ana nem baris lan patang kolom. Baris kapisan isine judhul. Saka kiwa menyang tengen, judhul kolome yaiku operasi, frasa tembung, tuladha, lan ekspresi. Ing kolom operasi ana pangurangan. Ing kolom frasa tembung ana dikurangi, selisih, suda kanthi pangurangan, minangka pangurangan saka, lan dikurangake saka. Kolom tuladha isine 5 dikurangi 1, selisih 9 lan 4, 7 suda kanthi pangurangan 3, 5 minangka pangurangan saka 8, lan 1 dikurangake saka 6. Kolom ekspresi isine 5 − 1, 9 − 4, 7 − 3, 8 − 5, lan 6 − 1."><tgroup cols="4"><colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Operasi</entry>
<entry align="left">Frasa Tembung</entry>
<entry align="left">Tuladha</entry>
<entry align="left">Ekspresi</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
  <entry valign="top" align="left">Pangurangan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">dikurangi</entry>
<entry><m:math><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math> dikurangi <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math></entry>
<entry><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry />
  <entry>selisih</entry>
  <entry>selisih <m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  <entry><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry />
  <entry>suda kanthi pangurangan</entry>
  <entry><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> suda kanthi pangurangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  <entry><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>

</row>
<row>
<entry />
  <entry>minangka pangurangan saka</entry>
  <entry><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> minangka pangurangan saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  <entry><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
<entry />
    <entry>dikurangake saka</entry>

<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> dikurangake saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>

<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>

</tgroup>
</table><example id="fs-id2297604">
<exercise id="fs-id2564560"><problem id="fs-id1474802">
<para id="fs-id1270867">Owahana, banjur prasajakna:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168287211491" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> selisih <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:math></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> kurangana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>43</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1594955">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<list id="eip-id1168287211527" list-type="labeled-item" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <para id="eip-id1168287211532">Tembung <emphasis effect="italics">selisih</emphasis> njaluk kita ngurangi rong wilangan kuwi. Urutane tetep kaya ing frasa.</para>
<table id="eip-id1168289460345" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Langkah-langkah ngowahi frasa tembung matematika dadi ekspresi, banjur mrasajakake dadi nilai wilangan."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>

    <entry />
    <entry>selisih 13 lan 8 </entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Owahana.</entry>

    <entry><m:math><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Prasajakna.</entry>

    <entry>5</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>

</tgroup>
</table></item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <para id="eip-id1168288218378">Tembung-tembung <emphasis effect="italics">kurangana</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">saka</emphasis> njaluk kita njupuk wilangan kapisan saka wilangan kapindho. Sing ngati-ati supaya urutane bener.</para>
<table id="eip-id1168287585454" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake langkah-langkah ngowahi soal crita dadi ekspresi matematika, banjur mrasajakake dadi asil wilangan."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry />

    <entry>kurangana 24 saka 43 </entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Owahana.</entry>

    <entry><m:math><m:mn>43</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Prasajakna.</entry>

    <entry>19</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>

</tgroup>
</table></item></list></solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id1368904" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2262948"><problem id="fs-id3400211">
<para id="fs-id1788606">Owahana lan prasajakna:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168287201538" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> selisih <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:math> </item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> kurangana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>21</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>37</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2619048">
<list id="eip-id1168289744400" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 14 − 9 = 5 </item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 37 − 21 = 16</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id1171103491683" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1508933"><problem id="fs-id1246927">
<para id="fs-id1171105193959">Owahana lan prasajakna:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168288492687" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:math> suda kanthi pangurangan <m:math><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:math> minangka pangurangan saka <m:math><m:mn>67</m:mn></m:math></item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1544573">
<list id="eip-id1168288224096" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 11 − 6 = 5 </item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> 67 − 18 = 49</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
</section>
<section id="fs-id1828922">
<title>Ngurangi Wilangan Cacah ing Penerapan</title>
<para id="fs-id1842344">Kanggo ngrampungake <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00003">penerapan</term> sing nganggo pangurangan, kita nggunakake rencana kaya nalika nambah. Kapisan, goleki apa sing dijaluk. Banjur tulisen frasa sing menehi informasi kanggo nggoleki. Owahana frasa kuwi dadi notasi matematika, banjur prasajakna supaya entuk wangsulan. Pungkasan, tulisen ukara kanggo mangsuli pitakon nganggo satuan sing cocog.</para>
<example id="fs-id1827542"><exercise id="fs-id1827544"><problem id="fs-id768604">
<para id="fs-id768606">Ing sawijining esuk, suhu ing Chicago yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>73</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> derajat Fahrenheit. Massa hawa adhem teka, lan nalika meh awan suhune dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> derajat Fahrenheit. Pira selisih suhu esuk lan suhu awan?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1397059">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id1151361">Kita dijaluk nggoleki selisih suhu esuk lan suhu awan.</para>
<table id="eip-505" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake langkah-langkah ngowahi frasa tembung dadi soal pangurangan lan ngetung selisihe."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen sawijining frasa.</entry>

    <entry>selisih 73 lan 27</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Owahana dadi notasi matematika. Tembung <emphasis effect="italics">selisih</emphasis> njaluk kita ngurangi.</entry>

    <entry><m:math><m:mn>73</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Banjur kita ngurangi.</entry>

    <entry align="left"><media id="eip-id1168287251681" alt="Pangurangan vertikal 73 karo 27 ngasilake 46. Carane nyilih saka puluhan, yaiku 7 dadi 6 lan 3 dadi 13, dituduhake kanthi cetha."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_032.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen ukara kanggo mangsuli pitakon.</entry>

    <entry>Selisih suhune 46 derajat Fahrenheit.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>


</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id2626691" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1862405">
<problem id="fs-id1233159">
<para id="fs-id1233161">Suhu paling dhuwur ing <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>Juni</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:msup><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mtext /></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> ing Boston yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>77</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> derajat Fahrenheit, dene suhu paling endhek <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>58</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> derajat Fahrenheit. Pira selisih suhu paling dhuwur lan paling endhek?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1631128">
<para id="fs-id2265563">Selisihe 19 derajat Fahrenheit.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id3959711" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id4133018">
<problem id="fs-id1731487">
<para id="fs-id1731489">Prakiraan cuaca tanggal <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> Juni ing St. Louis ngira-ngira suhu paling dhuwur <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>90</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> derajat Fahrenheit lan suhu paling endhek <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>73</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> derajat Fahrenheit. Pira selisih suhu paling dhuwur lan paling endhek sing diprakirakake?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1509608">
<para id="fs-id2582634">Selisihe 17 derajat Fahrenheit.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id942857"><exercise id="fs-id3016565">
<problem id="fs-id3016567">
<para id="fs-id1342007">Ana mesin cuci didol kanthi rega promosi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$399</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Rega lumrahe <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$588</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira selisih rega lumrah lan rega promosine?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1568270">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id2256365">Kita dijaluk nggoleki selisih rega lumrah lan rega promosi.</para>
<table id="eip-366" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake langkah-langkah ngrampungake soal crita pangurangan, wiwit nyusun frasa nganti wangsulan pungkasan."><label /><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen sawijining frasa.</entry>

    <entry>selisih 588 lan 399</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Owahana dadi notasi matematika.</entry>

    <entry><m:math><m:mn>588</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>399</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kurangana.</entry>

    <entry align="left"><media id="eip-id1168288553773" alt="Soal pangurangan telung kolom ditata kanggo nuduhake 588 dikurangi 399. Langkah nyilihe dituduhake, lan wangsulane 189."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_03_033.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen ukara kanggo mangsuli pitakon.</entry>

    <entry>Selisih rega lumrah lan rega promosi $189.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>


</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id2202283" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1582423">
<problem id="fs-id1620294">
<para id="fs-id1620296">Ana televisi didol kanthi rega promosi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$499</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Rega lumrahe <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$648</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira selisih rega lumrah lan rega promosine?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2771860">
<para id="fs-id2771862">Selisihe $149.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1632827" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2150255">
<problem id="fs-id2150257">
<para id="fs-id1298092">Ana set prabot teras didol kanthi rega promosi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$149</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Rega lumrahe <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$285</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira selisih rega lumrah lan rega promosine?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1258293">
<para id="fs-id2976317">Selisihe $136.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1580677" class="media-2"><title>BUKAK SUMBER DARING TAMBAHAN</title><list id="fs-id2877317" display="block">
<item><link url="https://www.openstax.org/l/24sub2dignum">Nggambarake pangurangan wilangan cacah rong digit nganggo model</link></item>
<item><link url="https://www.openstax.org/l/24sub3dignum">Nggambarake pangurangan wilangan cacah telung digit nganggo model</link></item>
<item><link url="https://www.openstax.org/l/24subwholenum">Ngurangi Wilangan Cacah</link></item>
</list>
</note></section>
<section id="fs-id1379009" class="key-concepts"><title>Bab-bab Sing Pokok</title><table id="eip-id1170326137930" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki ana rong baris lan limang kolom. Baris paling ndhuwur isine judhul. Saka kiwa menyang tengen, judhul kolome yaiku operasi, notasi, ekspresi, diwaca, lan asil. Ing sangisore operasi ana pangurangan; ing sangisore notasi ana tandha kurang; ing sangisore ekspresi ana pitu dikurangi telu; ing sangisore diwaca ana tembung pitu dikurangi telu; lan ing sangisore asil ana tembung selisih 7 lan 3.">
<label />
<tgroup cols="5">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Operasi</entry>
<entry align="left">Notasi</entry>
<entry align="left">Ekspresi</entry>
<entry align="left">Diwaca</entry>
<entry align="left">Asil</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Pangurangan</entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left">pitu dikurangi telu</entry>
<entry align="left">selisih <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<list id="eip-222"><item><emphasis>Ngurangi wilangan cacah.</emphasis>
<list id="eip-id1170325125107" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Tulisen wilangane supaya saben nilai panggonan sejajar vertikal.</item>
<item>Kurangana digit ing saben nilai panggonan. Miwitia saka satuan, banjur terus saka tengen menyang kiwa. Yen digit ndhuwur luwih cilik tinimbang digit ngisor, silihen yen perlu.</item>
<item>Terusna ngurangi saben nilai panggonan saka tengen menyang kiwa. Silihen yen perlu.</item>
<item>Priksa kanthi nambah.</item></list></item>
</list></section><section id="fs-id2649429" class="section-exercises"><section id="fs-id2908415" class="practice-perfect">
<title>Gladhen supaya Luwih Trampil</title>
<para id="fs-id2219786"><emphasis effect="bold">Nggunakake Notasi Pangurangan</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-987">Ing gladhen iki, owahana notasi matematika dadi tembung.</para><exercise id="fs-id1852234">
<problem id="fs-id1852236">
<para id="fs-id2431916"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1885585">
<para id="fs-id1885587">limalas dikurangi sanga; selisih limalas lan sanga</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1730448">
<problem id="fs-id1969228">
<para id="fs-id1969230"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1367647">
<problem id="fs-id2629662">
<para id="fs-id2629664"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>42</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>35</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1522283">
<para id="fs-id1340527">patang puluh loro dikurangi telung puluh lima; selisih patang puluh loro lan telung puluh lima</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1372720">
<problem id="fs-id1372722">
<para id="fs-id1379209"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>83</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>64</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1627318">
<problem id="fs-id1627320">
<para id="fs-id2711486"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>675</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>350</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id3335833">
<para id="fs-id3335835">nem atus pitung puluh lima dikurangi telung atus sèket; selisih nem atus pitung puluh lima lan telung atus sèket</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id4876753">
<problem id="fs-id4876755">
<para id="fs-id2606920"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>790</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>525</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id2133065"><emphasis effect="bold">Nggambarake Pangurangan Wilangan Cacah Nganggo Model</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-107">Ing gladhen iki, gawea model pangurangane.</para><exercise id="fs-id4337624">
