<para id="fs-id1531037">Selisih <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1,000</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>945</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id2650348"><emphasis effect="bold">Ngurangi Wilangan Cacah ing Penerapan</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-726">Ing gladhen iki, rampungna soal.</para><exercise id="fs-id3321482">
<problem id="fs-id3321484">
<para id="fs-id2377095"><emphasis effect="bold">Suhu</emphasis> Suhu paling dhuwur ing tanggal <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> Juni ing Las Vegas yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>80</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> derajat, dene suhu paling endhek <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>63</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> derajat. Pira selisih suhu paling dhuwur lan paling endhek?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1373291">
<para id="fs-id1373294">Selisih suhu paling dhuwur lan paling endhek 17 derajat.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1057274">
<problem id="fs-id1057276">
<para id="fs-id4433565"><emphasis effect="bold">Suhu</emphasis> Suhu paling dhuwur ing tanggal <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> Juni ing Phoenix yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>97</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> derajat, dene suhu paling endhek <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>73</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> derajat. Pira selisih suhu paling dhuwur lan paling endhek?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id4131869">
<problem id="fs-id2173766">
<para id="fs-id2173768"><emphasis effect="bold">Cacah siswa</emphasis> Ing kelas telune Olivia ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>35</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> bocah. Taun kepungkur, ing kelas lorone ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>22</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> bocah. Pira selisih cacah bocah ing kelas telu lan kelas lorone Olivia?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2590425">
<para id="fs-id2590427">Selisih cacah bocah ing kelas telu lan kelas loro 13 bocah.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1341997">
<problem id="fs-id1342000">
<para id="fs-id3011329"><emphasis effect="bold">Cacah siswa</emphasis> Ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>82</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> siswa ing grup musik sekolah lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>46</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> siswa ing orkestra sekolah. Pira selisih cacah siswa ing grup musik lan orkestra?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1628108">
<problem id="fs-id1816173">
<para id="fs-id1816175"><emphasis effect="bold">Blanja</emphasis> Ana sepedha gunung didol kanthi rega promosi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$399</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Rega lumrahe <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$650</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira selisih rega lumrah lan rega promosine?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1597793">
<para id="fs-id1916174">Selisih rega lumrah lan rega promosi $251.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2661110">
<problem id="fs-id2661112">
<para id="fs-id2786033"><emphasis effect="bold">Blanja</emphasis> Ana set kasur didol kanthi rega promosi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$755</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Rega lumrahe <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$1,600</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira selisih rega lumrah lan rega promosine?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2209737">
<problem id="fs-id1575031">
<para id="fs-id1575034"><emphasis effect="bold">Tabungan</emphasis> John kepengin tuku laptop regane <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$840</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Dheweke duwe <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$685</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> ing rekening tabungane. Dheweke perlu nabung pira maneh supaya bisa tuku laptop kuwi?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2792025">
<para id="fs-id2792028">John perlu nabung $155 maneh.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id3227881">
<problem id="fs-id1386558">
<para id="fs-id1386560"><emphasis effect="bold">Perbankan</emphasis> Mason duwe <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$1,125</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> ing rekening girone. Dheweke mblanjakake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$892</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Kari pira dhuwite?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
</section><section id="fs-id2141061" class="everyday">
<title>Matematika Saben Dina</title>
<exercise id="fs-id1782279">
<problem id="fs-id1966743">
<para id="fs-id1966745"><emphasis effect="bold">Lelungan liwat darat</emphasis> Noah nyopir saka Philadelphia menyang Cincinnati, sing adohe <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil. Dheweke nyopir nganti <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>115</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil, mandheg kanggo ngisi bahan bakar, banjur nyopir maneh nganti <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>23</m:mn><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil sadurunge mangan awan. Dheweke isih kudu nyopir pira mil maneh?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1364660">
<para id="fs-id1364662">157 mil</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1835207">
<problem id="fs-id1835209">
<para id="fs-id2452879"><emphasis effect="bold">Bijining ujian</emphasis> Sara butuh <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>35</m:mn><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> poin supaya lulus mata kuliahe. Ing patang ujian kapisane, dheweke entuk biji <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>75</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>50</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>70</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>80</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>. Sara butuh pira poin maneh supaya lulus mata kuliah kuwi?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
</section>
<section id="fs-id2443393" class="writing">
<title>Gladhen Nulis</title>
<exercise id="fs-id1967686">
<problem id="fs-id1967689">
<para id="fs-id1967691">Terangna gegayutan pangurangan lan panambahan.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2264295">
<para id="fs-id1366534">Wangsulan bisa beda-beda.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1394772">
<problem id="fs-id1394774">
<para id="fs-id1394776">Kepriye nguwasani fakta panambahan mbantu kowe ngurangi wilangan?</para>
</problem>
</exercise></section><section id="eip-538" class="self-check"><title>Priksa Dhewe</title><para id="eip-id1168466285113"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Sawise ngrampungake gladhen, gunakna daftar priksa iki kanggo mbiji apa kowe wis nguwasani ancas sinau bagean iki.
</para>

<figure id="eip-id1164272051982" class="unnumbered"><label /><media id="eip-id1164272051986" alt="Tabel kanggo mbiji dhewe katrampilan ngurangi. Kowe bisa milih 'Yakin', 'Kanthi pitulungan sethithik', utawa 'Ora—aku durung ngerti' kanggo limang ancas sinau."><image mime-type="image/jpg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_AppB_004.jpg" /></media></figure>


<para id="eip-id1168466075811"><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Saka daftar priksa iki, apa sing kokweruhi bab pangwasanmu ing bagean iki? Langkah apa sing bakal koktindakake supaya luwih nguwasani?
</para></section></section>
</content>
<glossary>
<definition id="fs-id1334793">
<term>selisih</term>
<meaning id="fs-id1602243">Selisih iku asil ngurangi rong wilangan utawa luwih.</meaning>
</definition>
</glossary>
</document>
